来来来
You know what?

354
00:16:26,710 --> 00:16:28,150
无所谓  随你怎么写
It's fine. Write whatever you want.

355
00:16:28,150 --> 00:16:30,820
顺便说一下  罗根·迪恩可以自称身高172
And by the way, Logan Dean can tell everyone he's five-eight,

356
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:33,470
但鬼才相信呢
but he's not fooling anybody!

357
00:16:43,670 --> 00:16:45,650
你确定要走这一步吗
Are you sure that's the move you want to make?

358
00:16:45,650 --> 00:16:47,420
当然
Absolutely.

359
00:16:48,220 --> 00:16:49,900
好吧
Okay.

360
00:16:51,310 --> 00:16:52,740
将军
Checkmate.

361
00:16:54,180 --> 00:16:56,510
我真没料到会这样
Oh, I did not see that coming.

362
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,490
棋高一着啊  艾米
That's well played, Amy.

363
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:01,590
怎么回事
What's going on?

364
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:06,020
你赢了我  我回以谦逊和钦佩
You beat me, and I am responding with humility and admiration.

365
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:07,630
不然你觉得是什么
What does it look like?

366
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:09,850
你故意让我赢的
You let me win so you could show me

367
00:17:09,850 --> 00:17:12,870
好让我看到你在情感上有多成熟  对不对
how emotionally mature you are, didn't you?

368
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,530
我等不到你凭实力赢我啊
Well, I couldn't wait for you to actually beat me;

369
00:17:14,530 --> 00:17:16,430
那得等到天荒地老
that would take forever.

370
00:17:17,710 --> 00:17:19,300
对不起
I'm sorry. It's...

371
00:17:19,300 --> 00:17:20,540
我想让你看到
I'm trying to show you

372
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:22,050
我能改变
that I can change.

373
00:17:22,050 --> 00:17:25,640
我不希望你为了我错过想做的事情
I-I don't want you to miss out on things because of me.

374
00:17:26,130 --> 00:17:27,660
我知道
I know you don't.

375
00:17:27,670 --> 00:17:29,600
还有  也许在世上某处
You know, and maybe somewhere out there,

376
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:33,100
有个小女孩看到你上威尔的节目后
there is a little girl who will see you on Wil's show

377
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:35,460
意识到自己长大后
and realize that she, too, can grow up

378
00:17:35,460 --> 00:17:37,510
也可以变成如此聪明  有才
to be a brilliant, amazing,

379
00:17:37,510 --> 00:17:39,740
成功的科学家
successful scientist.

380
00:17:41,490 --> 00:17:42,530
谢谢
Thank you.

381
00:17:42,530 --> 00:17:45,360
尽管她象棋下得超烂
Who is really terrible at chess.

382
00:17:46,450 --> 00:17:47,020
知道了
Got it.

383
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:49,270
不不  我是说烂出新境界
No, no, no. I mean really bad.

384
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:52,660
你的皇后在那干嘛呢  逛大街吗
What was your queen doing over there, going shopping?

385
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:58,220
我不是有意把佩妮写进去的
I mean, I-I didn't intend to write about Penny,

386
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:00,840
但也许我潜意识地这么做了
but I guess maybe subconsciously I did.

387
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:03,870
你是想说"无意识地"吧  亲爱的
I believe you mean "unconsciously" dear.

388
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:07,070
对啦  要是你不总是纠正我
Yeah, sure. You know, it would be nice

389
00:18:07,070 --> 00:18:08,960
那就最好不过了
if you didn't correct me all the time.

390
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:11,620
要是你没地方被纠正  那也挺好的
It would be nice if I didn't have to.

391
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:15,670
也许你写这本书是个坏主意
Maybe this book of yours is a bad idea.

392
00:18:15,670 --> 00:18:16,410
此话怎讲
What do you mean?

393
00:18:16,410 --> 00:18:17,770
你只是个物理学家
Well, you're a physicist.

394
00:18:17,770 --> 00:18:21,650
凭什么觉得自己能写书
What makes you think you can write a book?

395
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:26,870
你只是个物理学家
You're a physicist.

396
00:18:26,870 --> 00:18:30,340
凭什么觉得自己能侦破罪案
What makes you think you can solve a crime?

397
00:18:32,530 --> 00:18:33,320
我需告辞了
Got to go.

398
00:18:33,320 --> 00:18:35,380
应该是我"得"
I think you mean "Have..."

399
00:18:37,310 --> 00:18:38,310
佩妮  好消息
Oh, Penny, good news.

400
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:39,990
-那不是你  -什么
- It's not you. - What?

401
00:18:39,990 --> 00:18:41,870
艾尔莎  不是你  是我妈
Ilsa. It's not you. It's my mother.

402
00:18:41,870 --> 00:18:44,180
原来我一直在写我妈
I've been writing about my mother!

403
00:18:44,740 --> 00:18:47,000
我想你忘了你自己也有动机
I think you're neglecting your own motive,

404
00:18:47,010 --> 00:18:49,530
你那巨大的自卑情结
a massive inferiority complex.

405
00:18:49,530 --> 00:18:51,430
才没那么大呢
It's not massive.

406
00:18:51,430 --> 00:18:53,420
也就是中等大小吧
It's just average-sized.

407
00:18:57,930 --> 00:18:59,410
我们得找些绷带
We got to find some bandages.

408
00:18:59,410 --> 00:19:01,420
没时间了
There's no time.

409
00:19:05,720 --> 00:19:06,980
痛吗
Does it hurt?

410
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:09,260
你所做的一切都令我痛
Everything you do hurts.

411
00:19:10,190 --> 00:19:12,630
那你为何一直来找虐
Then why do you keep coming back for more?

412
00:19:12,630 --> 00:19:14,360
也许你喜欢这种感觉
Maybe you like it.

413
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:17,470
可能真是这样
I-- M-Maybe I do.

414
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:26,340
我只不过是个物理学家  我写个毛书啊
You know what? I'm a physicist. What am I doing writing a book?

415
00:19:32,330 --> 00:19:33,840
今天的节目就要到此为止了
Well, that is our show for today.

416
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,750
我想特别向艾米·福勒博士道谢
And I want to say a very special thank you

417
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:37,660
感谢您的光临
to Dr. Amy Fowler for being here.

418
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:39,400
能邀请到你  我们感到十分开心
It was a real pleasure having you.

419
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:41,000
你能感受到那份开心
And you can feel that pleasure

420
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:46,110
因为你的伏核里没有病变
because you don't have a lesion in your nucleus accumbens.

421
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:48,540
真心希望我没有
I really hope I don't.

422
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,410
好啦  下次见
All right, we'll see you next time!

423
00:19:53,970 --> 00:19:55,350
艾米
Amy.

424
00:19:55,350 --> 00:19:57,180
你简直在发光
You were glowing.

425
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:01,490
因为头皮很油啦
Oily scalp.

426
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:04,400
我真以你为傲
I'm so proud of you.

427
00:20:05,290 --> 00:20:07,270
我也以你为傲
And I'm proud of you.

428
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:09,960
因为你看不出我有多妒忌吗
Because you can't tell how jealous I am?

429
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,100
不不  我看得出来
No, no, no. I can.

430
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:15,680
我能看出你忍得有多辛苦
I can tell how hard you're trying to keep it in.

431
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:17,370
忍到内伤
Really hard.

432
00:20:19,830 --> 00:20:20,640
我去睡了
I'm gonna go to bed.

433
00:20:20,650 --> 00:20:21,880
好的  我去屋顶上大叫发泄了
All right. I'm gonna go scream on the roof.

434
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,670
-爱你哦  -爱你哦
- Love you. - Love you.

